flowchart TB
  Start["Host assembles required context<br/>questions, state and envelope"] --> First["Decisions: initial full-request assessment"]
  First --> Gate{"Budget assessment"}
  Gate -->|"within limit and allowed accounting"| Ready["Admitted body<br/>send the exact assessed bytes"]
  Gate -->|"required overflow or unverifiable"| Block["Budget diagnostic<br/>no inference or rule pass"]
  Gate -->|"overflow and optional excerpts available"| Omit["Host: one optional omission pass<br/>record removed context"]
  Omit --> Second["Decisions: assess changed body once"]
  Second --> Final{"Final budget assessment"}
  Final -->|"within limit and allowed accounting"| Ready
  Final -->|"still over limit or unverifiable"| Block
  Cancel["Invocation owner observes cancellation<br/>before terminal admission or inference"] -.-> Join["Stop scheduling and join owned work"]
  Join --> Cancelled["Settled cancellation<br/>no new inference"]
